1
00:00:00,776 --> 00:00:01,946
Helm Stuart

2
00:00:03,479 --> 00:00:05,619
(Sheldon:)-Hey.
-Sorry. Did I startle you?

3
00:00:05,781 --> 00:00:09,131
(Stuart:)Yes, but at this point, pretty
much any customer does.

4
00:00:09,985 --> 00:00:12,485
(Stuart:)-What can I do for you?
-Well, I need a little help.

5
00:00:12,654 --> 00:00:15,264
(Bernadette:)I accidentally destroyed one of
Howard's comic books this morning,

6
00:00:15,424 --> 00:00:17,994
(Bernadette:)-and was hoping I could replace it.
-Wow. What happened?

7
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,830
(Bernadette:)Batman got his ass kicked
by my curling iron.

8
00:00:22,831 --> 00:00:25,111
(Stuart:)Don't let The Riddler know that.

9
00:00:26,769 --> 00:00:28,939
(Stuart:)It's a comic book joke.

10
00:00:30,272 --> 00:00:32,182
(Stuart:)Or maybe it's not.

11
00:00:33,142 --> 00:00:36,122
(Bernadette:)-Do you have this one?
-Well, it's pretty rare.

12
00:00:36,278 --> 00:00:38,318
(Stuart:)Can you give me a few
days to track it down?

13
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:41,360
(Bernadette:)I was kind of hoping to get it
before Howie comes home from work.

14
00:00:41,517 --> 00:00:43,297
(Stuart:)-What's the hurry?
-Well, he's always saying

15
00:00:43,452 --> 00:00:45,452
(Bernadette:)I should be more careful
with my curling iron,

16
00:00:45,621 --> 00:00:46,961
(Bernadette:)and it seems like
a dangerous precedent

17
00:00:47,122 --> 00:00:49,332
(Bernadette:)to let him think he can be right.

18
00:00:50,526 --> 00:00:53,806
(Stuart:)Well, I'll do what I can,
but I can't make any promises.

19
00:00:54,663 --> 00:00:58,513
(Bernadette:)You know, I do work
at a pharmaceutical company.

20
00:00:58,667 --> 00:01:00,447
(Bernadette:)If you can make this happen today,

